title: "PNT to WAB Subscore Predictor"
abstract: >-
  A client-side web application that predicts 13 Western Aphasia Battery
  subscores from Philadelphia Naming Test error-type counts alone, using
  gradient-boosted and linear models exported to ONNX and run in-browser.
